{"step_index":85,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:18:14Z","thinking":"**Implementing the Main Agent**\n\nI'm now writing `Main_Stickman.py` to provide a final summary of the process, as instructed. It's time to build this final component, and then the whole system can be tested. I'll make sure this main agent is robust and clearly presents the information requested.\n\n\n**Constructing the Stickman**\n\nI'm now focusing on the visual representation. I've defined the ground as a polygon with a specific color and stroke. Most of the stickman will be white, with defined dimensions. I'm adding legs, feet, and a shadow, with ellipses for the body and feet. Arms will be represented with arcs, hands with circles, and semi-circles will form the ears. I'm building eyes and eyebrows as described, aiming for a bored expression.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"from manim import *\nimport numpy as np\n\nclass MainStickmanScene(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Background Sky\n        self.camera.background_color = \"#E7C651\"\n        \n        # Ground\n        ground = Polygon(\n            [-10, -2.5, 0], [10, -2.5, 0], [10, -5, 0], [-10, -5, 0],\n            color=BLACK, stroke_width=6, fill_color=\"#9E9169\", fill_opacity=1\n        )\n        # Ground details (some curved lines)\n        g_line1 = ArcBetweenPoints([-10, -2.5, 0], [2, -3.5, 0], angle=-0.2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=5)\n        g_line2 = ArcBetweenPoints([2, -3.5, 0], [10, -2.0, 0], angle=0.2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=5)\n        g_line3 = ArcBetweenPoints([-4, -5, 0], [-2, -3.2, 0], angle=-0.1, color=BLACK, stroke_width=5)\n        ground_group = VGroup(ground, g_line1, g_line2, g_line3)\n\n        # Shadow\n        shadow = Ellipse(width=3.5, height=0.6, color=BLACK, stroke_width=0, fill_opacity=0.3)\n        shadow.shift(DOWN * 3.4)\n\n        # --- CHARACTER PARTS ---\n        stroke_style = {\"color\": BLACK, \"stroke_width\": 7}\n        fill_style = {\"fill_color\": WHITE, \"fill_opacity\": 1}\n\n        # Body\n        body = Ellipse(width=2.4, height=3.2, **stroke_style, **fill_style)\n        body.shift(DOWN * 0.5)\n\n        # Head\n        head = Circle(radius=1.5, **stroke_style, **fill_style)\n        head.shift(UP * 1.5)\n\n        # Ears\n        ear_l = Arc(radius=0.3, start_angle=PI/2, angle=PI, **stroke_style, **fill_style)\n        ear_l.move_to(head.get_left() + LEFT*0.1)\n        ear_r = Arc(radius=0.3, start_angle=-PI/2, angle=PI, **stroke_style, **fill_style)\n        ear_r.move_to(head.get_right() + RIGHT*0.1)\n\n        # Hair\n        hair_group = VGroup()\n        for i, (x, ang, rad) in enumerate([(-0.6, 1.2, 0.4), (-0.2, 1.5, 0.5), (0.3, 1.8, 0.4), (0.8, 1.2, 0.3)]):\n            hair = Arc(radius=rad, start_angle=PI, angle=-PI/2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=5)\n            hair.move_to(head.get_top() + RIGHT * x + UP * (0.3 + 0.1*(i%2)))\n            hair_group.add(hair)\n\n        # Eyes (Bored Expression)\n        eye_l = Circle(radius=0.35, **stroke_style, **fill_style).move_to(head.get_center() + LEFT*0.5 + UP*0.2)\n        eye_r = Circle(radius=0.35, **stroke_style, **fill_style).move_to(head.get_center() + RIGHT*0.5 + UP*0.2)\n        \n        # Eyelids cutting off the eyes\n        lid_l = Line(eye_l.get_left() + UP*0.05, eye_l.get_right() + UP*0.05, color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)\n        lid_r = Line(eye_r.get_left() + UP*0.05, eye_r.get_right() + UP*0.05, color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)\n        \n        # Pupils (half circles under the lid)\n        pupil_l = Arc(radius=0.15, start_angle=PI, angle=PI, color=BLACK, stroke_width=0, fill_opacity=1)\n        pupil_l.next_to(lid_l, DOWN, buff=0)\n        pupil_r = Arc(radius=0.15, start_angle=PI, angle=PI, color=BLACK, stroke_width=0, fill_opacity=1)\n        pupil_r.next_to(lid_r, DOWN, buff=0)\n\n        # Eyebrows\n        brow_l = Line(eye_l.get_top() + LEFT*0.2 + UP*0.2, eye_l.get_top() + RIGHT*0.2 + UP*0.15, color=BLACK, stroke_width=8)\n        brow_r = Line(eye_r.get_top() + LEFT*0.2 + UP*0.15, eye_r.get_top() + RIGHT*0.2 + UP*0.2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=8)\n\n        # Nose\n        nose = Arc(radius=0.15, start_angle=PI, angle=PI, color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)\n        nose.move_to(head.get_center() + DOWN * 0.3)\n\n        # Mouth (frown)\n        mouth = Arc(radius=0.6, start_angle=PI/4, angle=PI/2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)\n        mouth.move_to(head.get_center() + DOWN * 0.7)\n\n        # Arms (Akimbo)\n        arm_l = VGroup(\n            Line(body.get_left() + UP*0.2, body.get_left() + LEFT*1.2 + DOWN*0.5, color=BLACK, stroke_width=7),\n            Line(body.get_left() + LEFT*1.2 + DOWN*0.5, body.get_left() + DOWN*1.5 + RIGHT*0.2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=7)\n        )\n        arm_r = VGroup(\n            Line(body.get_right() + UP*0.2, body.get_right() + RIGHT*1.2 + DOWN*0.5, color=BLACK, stroke_width=7),\n            Line(body.get_right() + RIGHT*1.2 + DOWN*0.5, body.get_right() + DOWN*1.5 + LEFT*0.2, color=BLACK, stroke_width=7)\n        )\n\n        # Hands\n        hand_l = Circle(radius=0.3, **stroke_style, **fill_style).move_to(body.get_left() + DOWN*1.5 + RIGHT*0.2)\n        hand_r = Circle(radius=0.3, **stroke_style, **fill_style).move_to(body.get_right() + DOWN*1.5 + LEFT*0.2)\n        # Thumb/finger detail lines\n        f_l1 = Line(hand_l.get_right(), hand_l.get_center() + DOWN*0.1, color=BLACK, stroke_width=5)\n        f_r1 = Line(hand_r.get_left(), hand_r.get_center() + DOWN*0.1, color=BLACK, stroke_width=5)\n\n        # Legs\n        leg_l = Line(body.get_bottom() + LEFT*0.4, body.get_bottom() + LEFT*0.5 + DOWN*1.5, color=BLACK, stroke_width=7)\n        leg_r = Line(body.get_bottom() + RIGHT*0.4, body.get_bottom() + RIGHT*0.5 + DOWN*1.5, color=BLACK, stroke_width=7)\n\n        # Feet\n        foot_l = Ellipse(width=1.0, height=0.4, **stroke_style, **fill_style).move_to(leg_l.get_end() + DOWN*0.1)\n        foot_r = Ellipse(width=1.0, height=0.4, **stroke_style, **fill_style).move_to(leg_r.get_end() + DOWN*0.1)\n\n        # Assemble Character\n        character = VGroup(\n            leg_l, leg_r, foot_l, foot_r,\n            arm_l, arm_r,\n            body, head, ear_l, ear_r, hair_group,\n            eye_l, eye_r, lid_l, lid_r, pupil_l, pupil_r,\n            brow_l, brow_r, nose, mouth,\n            hand_l, hand_r, f_l1, f_r1\n        )\n        \n        # Position adjustments to ensure overlapping lines match the image\n        body.set_z_index(10)\n        head.set_z_index(20)\n        ear_l.set_z_index(15)\n        ear_r.set_z_index(15)\n        hand_l.set_z_index(30)\n        hand_r.set_z_index(30)\n        foot_l.set_z_index(10)\n        foot_r.set_z_index(10)\n\n        # --- ANIMATION ---\n        self.play(Create(ground_group), run_time=1)\n        self.play(FadeIn(shadow), run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # Draw the character pieces\n        self.play(\n            Create(body), Create(head), \n            Create(leg_l), Create(leg_r), Create(foot_l), Create(foot_r),\n            Create(arm_l), Create(arm_r), Create(hand_l), Create(hand_r),\n            run_time=2.5\n        )\n        self.play(\n            Create(ear_l), Create(ear_r), Create(hair_group),\n            Create(f_l1), Create(f_r1),\n            run_time=1\n        )\n        self.play(\n            Create(eye_l), Create(eye_r), Create(nose), Create(mouth),\n            run_time=1\n        )\n        self.play(\n            Create(lid_l), Create(lid_r), \n            FadeIn(pupil_l), FadeIn(pupil_r), \n            Create(brow_l), Create(brow_r),\n            run_time=1\n        )\n        \n        self.wait(1)\n\n        # Blink animation\n        blink_lid_l = Line(eye_l.get_left(), eye_l.get_right(), color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)\n        blink_lid_l.move_to(eye_l.get_bottom() + UP*0.05)\n        blink_lid_r = Line(eye_r.get_left(), eye_r.get_right(), color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)\n        blink_lid_r.move_to(eye_r.get_bottom() + UP*0.05)\n\n        # Hide pupils, move lids down\n        self.play(\n            Transform(lid_l, blink_lid_l), Transform(lid_r, blink_lid_r),\n            FadeOut(pupil_l), FadeOut(pupil_r),\n            run_time=0.1\n        )\n        self.play(\n            Transform(lid_l, Line(eye_l.get_left() + UP*0.05, eye_l.get_right() + UP*0.05, color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)),\n            Transform(lid_r, Line(eye_r.get_left() + UP*0.05, eye_r.get_right() + UP*0.05, color=BLACK, stroke_width=6)),\n            FadeIn(pupil_l), FadeIn(pupil_r),\n            run_time=0.15\n        )\n        \n        self.wait(2)\n","Description":"Main Agent's implementation of the image reference using Manim shapes (Circle, Ellipse, Arc) and correct Z-indexes to match the 'Cyanide and Happiness' style exact proportions, background colors, and expressions.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\manim-projects\\main_stickman.py","toolAction":"Writing Main Stickman script","toolSummary":"Main Agent Stickman Script"}}]}
